From fed5c173c2217cecce2974a45ddd5fa40da30071 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Esteban Ordano <esteban@decentraland.org>
Date: Sat, 4 Jul 2026 19:34:06 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] chore(upm): resolve unity-shared-dependencies over
 anonymous https
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

decentraland/unity-shared-dependencies is a public repo; the manifest's
git@github.com: form forces an ssh key just to open the project. The https
form resolves with plain anonymous git. packages-lock.json gets the same
one-line rewrite so UPM keeps the pinned hash (f040030e) instead of
re-resolving.

This is the only functional change the abgen render-parity harness needs on
top of upstream: every other public git dependency already uses https, and
the private unity-explorer-packages URLs are left untouched (org access
required — see docs/ABGEN-COMPARE.md).

---
 Explorer/Packages/manifest.json      | 2 +-
 Explorer/Packages/packages-lock.json | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Explorer/Packages/manifest.json b/Explorer/Packages/manifest.json
index 02e7dab79..705ed8314 100644
--- a/Explorer/Packages/manifest.json
+++ b/Explorer/Packages/manifest.json
@@ -16,7 +16,7 @@
     "com.decentraland.renum.sourcegen": "https://github.com/NickKhalow/REnum.git#sourcegen/1.1.4",
